      "title": "Conversations: restrict the deinterlacing method to Ethernet wtap",
      "message": "Conversations: restrict the deinterlacing method to Ethernet wtap\n\nApplying any deinterlacing key to wiretaps different from Ethernet\nwas not behaving very well, giving some dissector errors.\nWhile some wiretaps could also have some kind of deinterlacing\n(such as SLL), it's preferable to restrict for now to Ethernet\nbefore any further additional feature.\n",
